
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="vi">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Giới thiệu bản thân</title>

    <style>
        * {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            box-sizing: border-box;
            scroll-behavior: smooth;
        }

        body {
            font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
            background: #f1f5f9;
            color: #263445;
            line-height: 1.7;
        }

        header {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #123456, #2878a8);
            color: white;
            text-align: center;
            padding: 55px 20px;
        }

        header h1 {
            font-size: 38px;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
        }

        nav {
            background: #102d46;
            text-align: center;
            padding: 15px;
            position: sticky;
            top: 0;
            z-index: 10;
        }

        nav a {
            color: white;
            text-decoration: none;
            margin: 0 15px;
            font-weight: bold;
        }

        nav a:hover {
            color: #70d6ff;
        }

        .container {
            max-width: 1000px;
            margin: auto;
            padding: 25px;
        }

        section {
            background: white;
            margin: 25px 0;
            padding: 30px;
            border-radius: 15px;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 12px #00000012;
        }

        h2 {
            color: #17618b;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
            border-bottom: 2px solid #d7eaf5;
            padding-bottom: 10px;
        }

        .profile {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 30px;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
        }

        .profile img {
            width: 220px;
            height: 250px;
            object-fit: cover;
            border-radius: 15px;
            border: 4px solid #d7eaf5;
        }

        .profile-info {
            flex: 1;
            min-width: 220px;
        }

        .info {
            margin: 10px 0;
        }

        .school-image {
            width: 100%;
            max-height: 400px;
            object-fit: cover;
            border-radius: 12px;
            margin: 15px 0;
        }

        video {
            width: 100%;
            border-radius: 12px;
            margin-top: 15px;
        }

        .quote {
            background: #eaf5fc;
            padding: 20px;
            border-left: 5px solid #2878a8;
            border-radius: 8px;
            margin-top: 15px;
        }

        footer {
            background: #102d46;
            color: white;
            text-align: center;
            padding: 25px;
            margin-top: 30px;
        }

        @media (max-width: 600px) {
            header h1 {
                font-size: 28px;
            }

            nav a {
                display: inline-block;
                margin: 5px 8px;
            }

            .profile {
                justify-content: center;
            }

            .profile img {
                width: 190px;
            }
        }
    </style>
</head>

<body>

    <!-- PHẦN ĐẦU TRANG -->
    <header>
        <h1>HELLO! I'm Ngô Duy Hưng</h1>
        <p>Chào mừng bạn đến với trang web giới thiệu bản thân của tôi!</p>
    </header>

    <!-- THANH ĐIỀU HƯỚNG -->
    <nav>
